<title>USA: Concord Camera Q2 Dec 31 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Concord Camera Q2 Dec 31 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>AVENEL, N.J. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONCORD CAMERA CORP</p>
<p>FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED DECEMBER 31,    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net sales				   $19,677,268  $17,863,775</p>
<p> Gross profit				  6,673,259    6,230,699</p>
<p> Selling expenses			    2,037,700    2,209,264</p>
<p> General and administrative expenses   2,463,677    2,133,728</p>
<p> Financial expenses			    374,637	408,906</p>
<p> Other (income), net			  (31,903)	(7,065)</p>
<p> Legal expenses and settlement costs	95,202	184,788</p>
<p>Income from operations before</p>
<p>  income taxes				 1,733,945    1,301,078</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes			602	    771</p>
<p> Net income				    1,733,344    1,300,307</p>
<p> Income per EPS				     0.16	   0.12</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs				10,882,973   11,145,130</p>
